,"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/containerRelativeFrame(_:alignment:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/containerRelativeFrame(_:alignment:_:)":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/containerRelativeFrame(_:alignment:_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"containerRelativeFrame","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Axis","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4AxisO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4AxisO3SetV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"alignment","kind":"ex